      "contentPreview": "C2 BLAST RADIUS RUNS ONE LEVEL DEEPER THAN THE REVIEW RECORDED. HttpMemoryStore.DiscoverTopics (:1368) calls ListScoped(null), and ResolveReadScopes(null) (:1403) is built on DiscoverTopics. So past 200 entries the failure is not \u0027the tail is missing\u0027 -- WHOLE SCOPES STOP EXISTING, and code that then lists them reports them empty. FileMemoryStore.ListScoped enumerates ResolveReadScopes then LoadIndex(scope) per scope, so entries arrive scope-by-scope and CONTIGUOUS: truncating 250 to 200 makes e",
